## Optimization (Interview Follow-up)

Interviewer:

Can you do better than sorting?

Answer:

Yes. We can use a Heap (Priority Queue) to achieve O(n log k) or Bucket Sort to achieve O(n). The dictionary + sorting solution is simpler and works well unless a more optimized solution is required.